{
  "__comment": "The item cannot parent block/p_grid any more: the shaft and the cogwheel are drawn by a Flywheel visual, which only exists for a placed block entity, so an item that inherited the block model would be missing both. Create's own crafter item does the same thing - it bakes cogwheel_shaftless into the item model. Body and kinetics are merged here with their uvs untouched; uvs are normalised by 16 regardless of the texture's real resolution, so there is nothing to rescale between the two. Deliberately the lit front, screen glow and all: an item is the thing you look at in the inventory and in EMI, and an unlit screen there reads as a dead machine.",
